# slug|operation|next step
windows|install|Launch Windows from the app launcher to download and complete Windows setup.
dictation|install|Open Dictation from the qvOS controls to start using it.
ruby-on-rails|install|Open a new terminal and run: rails new myproject
go|install|Open a new terminal and run: go version
php|install|Open a new terminal and run: php --version
python|install|Open a new terminal and run: python --version or uv --version
elixir|install|Open a new terminal and run: iex
zig|install|Open a new terminal and run: zig version
rust|install|Open a new terminal and run: rustc --version
java|install|Open a new terminal and run: java --version
dotnet|install|Open a new terminal and run: dotnet --info
clojure|install|Open a new terminal and run: clj
scala|install|Open a new terminal and run: scala-cli
node|install|Open a new terminal and run: node --version
bun|install|Open a new terminal and run: bun --version
deno|install|Open a new terminal and run: deno --version
laravel|install|Open a new terminal and run: laravel new myproject
symfony|install|Open a new terminal and run: symfony new --webapp myproject
phoenix|install|Open a new terminal and run: mix phx.new my_app
chrome|install|Open Setup > Defaults > Browser to make Chrome your default.
edge|install|Open Setup > Defaults > Browser to make Edge your default.
brave|install|Open Setup > Defaults > Browser to make Brave your default.
brave-origin|install|Open Setup > Defaults > Browser to make Brave Origin your default.
firefox|install|Open Setup > Defaults > Browser to make Firefox your default.
zen|install|Open Setup > Defaults > Browser to make Zen your default.
steam|install|Open Steam and sign in.
retroarch|install|Add ROMs to ~/Games/roms and BIOS files to ~/Games/bios, then open RetroArch.
minecraft|install|Open Minecraft Launcher from the app launcher and sign in.
xbox-cloud|install|Open Xbox Cloud Gaming and sign in.
xbox-controller|install|After any required reboot, open Bluetooth settings to pair the controller.
moonlight|install|Open Moonlight and add your Sunshine host.
lutris|install|Open Lutris, wait for the runtimes, then use + to add games.
heroic|install|Open Heroic and sign in.
qvdev|install|Right-click a project folder and choose Open Codex Here.
dropbox|install|Open the top-right hidden tray, right-click Dropbox, and complete setup.
nordvpn|install|After rebooting, open a terminal and run: nordvpn login
bitwarden|install|Open Bitwarden and sign in.
chromium-account|install|Restart Chromium, then open Settings > You and Google to sign in.
vscode|install|Open VS Code from the app launcher.
cursor|install|Open Cursor from the app launcher.
zed|install|Open Zed from the app launcher.
sublime-text|install|Open Sublime Text from the app launcher.
helix|install|Open a new terminal and run: hx
vim|install|Open a terminal and run: vim
emacs|install|Open Emacs from the app launcher, or run: emacsclient -c
font-cascadia-mono|install|Open a new terminal to see the selected font.
font-meslo-mono|install|Open a new terminal to see the selected font.
font-fira-code|install|Open a new terminal to see the selected font.
font-victor-code|install|Open a new terminal to see the selected font.
font-bitstream-vera|install|Open a new terminal to see the selected font.
font-iosevka|install|Open a new terminal to see the selected font.
alacritty|install|Open a new terminal to use Alacritty as the default.
foot|install|Open a new terminal to use Foot as the default.
ghostty|install|Open a new terminal to use Ghostty as the default.
kitty|install|Open a new terminal to use Kitty as the default.
lm-studio|install|Open LM Studio from the app launcher to download or choose a model.
ollama|install|Open a terminal and run: ollama run <model>
crush|install|Open a terminal and run: crush
